                                                       RPN(LOCAL)NAME     rpn - a reverse polish notation calculatorSYNOPSIS     rpn [-]DESCRIPTION     Rpn takes the standard input and is a RPN calculator. If you     want verbose off, use 'rpn -'. For a more detailed descrip-     tion, type in 'help' from within rpn.BUGSMAN AUTHOR     Nils McCarthy (mtymp01@ux.acss.umn.edu)